tablegen-go
Copyright 2026 The tablegen-go Authors

This is an independent Go implementation of the TableGen language. It was
written by studying LLVM's TableGen sources; it contains no LLVM source code.
Comments cite LLVM C++ files and line numbers so that every non-obvious rule
can be checked against the reference implementation.

